Z||000000||RaeQwan||02-20-2001||11:00 PM||||a better chat client for the Forum Chat!<P>1. Go to  <A HREF="http://new.spinchat.com" TARGET=_blank>http://new.spinchat.com</A> <BR>2. Type in your name in the space given and hit enter. <I>note: not in the box that has a password box under it. unless you have registered your name</I><BR>3. Once you are logged in, click on chat rooms. It will have a smiley icon  <IMG SRC="http://static.spinchat.com/new/image/icon/icon-chat.gif">  beside it.<BR>4. Type in <B>_Fiero.nl</B> where it said 'or create your own channel. <I>note: the underscore must be on the channel name</I><BR>5. Click on Go.<BR>6. CHAT! CHAT! CHAT!||||reg||4
